    <string name="settings_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">LaBLEr %1$s\n\nIndependent FOSS app for Bluetooth LE label printers. The Marklife protocol was reverse-engineered from BleWebler, a web version for Chrome browsers that runs without installation; the Dymo one follows a published description. No code was taken.</string>
